## Rapport d'exploration complète de la structure de la page d'accueil

Voici tous les fichiers pertinents pour comprendre la structure actuelle et implémenter votre bannière de films/séries :

### 1. **Page d'accueil principale**
**Chemin:** `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/portfolio-loic/app/[locale]/page.tsx`
```tsx
import NeoHome from "@/components/neo-brutalist/NeoHome";

export const dynamic = "force-dynamic";

export default async function HomePage() {
  return <NeoHome />;
}
```
La page utilise le composant `NeoHome` qui est un composant client.

---

### 2. **Composant principal NeoHome**
**Chemin:** `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/portfolio-loic/components/neo-brutalist/NeoHome.tsx`
```tsx
"use client";

import React from "react";
import { motion, useScroll, useSpring } from "framer-motion";
import { CustomCursor } from "./ui/CustomCursor";
import { Marquee } from "./ui/Marquee";
import { NeoNavbar } from "./NeoNavbar";
import { NeoSplitHero } from "./NeoSplitHero";
import { NeoFooter } from "./NeoFooter";

// Partner logos for the marquee
const partnerLogos = [
  { src: "/img/partners/cezame-logo.png", alt: "Cezame Music Agency", size: "large" as const },
  { src: "/img/partners/gum-logo.png", alt: "GUM", size: "large" as const },
  { src: "/img/partners/myma-logo.png", alt: "MYMA", size: "normal" as const },
  { src: "/img/partners/superpitch-logo.png", alt: "Superpitch", size: "normal" as const },
  {
    src: "/img/partners/universal-production.png",
    alt: "Universal Production Music",
    size: "large" as const,
  },
  { src: "/img/partners/infinity-scores.jpeg", alt: "Infinity Scores", size: "normal" as const },
  { src: "/img/partners/superama-records.jpg", alt: "Superama Records", size: "normal" as const },
];

export default function NeoHome() {
  const { scrollYProgress } = useScroll();
  const scaleX = useSpring(scrollYProgress, { stiffness: 100, damping: 30, restDelta: 0.001 });

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-neo-bg text-neo-text font-sans selection:bg-neo-text selection:text-neo-accent overflow-x-hidden">
      <CustomCursor />

      {/* Top Progress Bar */}
      <motion.div
        className="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-neo-accent origin-left z-50"
        style={{ scaleX }}
      />

      {/* Grid Overlay */}
      <div
        className="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-[0.05]"
        style={{
          backgroundImage:
            "linear-gradient(var(--neo-border) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neo-border) 1px, transparent 1px)",
          backgroundSize: "60px 60px",
        }}
      />

      <NeoNavbar />

      <main className="relative z-10 pt-16 md:pt-20">
        <NeoSplitHero />
        <Marquee logos={partnerLogos} />
        <NeoFooter />
      </main>
    </div>
  );
}
```

**Structure logique:**
- `CustomCursor` : Curseur personnalisé
- Barre de progression du scroll en haut
- Grille d'arrière-plan fixe
- `NeoNavbar` : Navigation
- `NeoSplitHero` : Section héro avec lecteur SoundCloud
- `Marquee` : Bannière de logos partenaires (défilant)
- `NeoFooter` : Pied de page

---

### 3. **Composant NeoSplitHero (Section héro)**
**Chemin:** `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/portfolio-loic/components/neo-brutalist/NeoSplitHero.tsx`
```tsx
// (Voir le fichier lu plus haut - 365 lignes)
// Points clés:
// - Utilise Framer Motion pour les animations
// - Panneau gauche: texte avec titre, tagline
// - Panneau droit: lecteur SoundCloud persistant (sticky)
// - Classes Tailwind neo-* pour les couleurs et styles
```

---

### 4. **Composant Marquee (Bannière défilante)**
**Chemin:** `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/portfolio-loic/components/neo-brutalist/ui/Marquee.tsx`
```tsx
"use client";

import React from "react";
import Image from "next/image";

interface LogoItem {
  src: string;
  alt: string;
  size?: "normal" | "large";
}

interface MarqueeProps {
  items?: string[];
  logos?: LogoItem[];
  direction?: 1 | -1;
  speed?: number;
}

export const Marquee: React.FC<MarqueeProps> = ({ items, logos, direction = 1, speed = 30 }) => {
  // Mode logos (utilisé actuellement)
  if (logos && logos.length > 0) {
    return (
      <div className="relative flex overflow-hidden border-y-4 border-neo-border bg-neo-surface py-6 select-none">
        <div
          className="flex animate-marquee"
          style={{
            animationDirection: direction === 1 ? "normal" : "reverse",
            animationDuration: `${speed}s`,
          }}
        >
          {/* First set of logos */}
          {logos.map((logo, index) => (
            <span key={`first-${logo.alt}-${index}`} className="flex items-center shrink-0">
              <span className="mx-8 md:mx-16 flex items-center justify-center">
                <Image
                  src={logo.src}
                  alt={logo.alt}
                  width={logo.size === "large" ? 350 : 200}
                  height={logo.size === "large" ? 175 : 100}
                  className={`w-auto object-contain ${
                    logo.size === "large" ? "h-28 md:h-44" : "h-16 md:h-24"
                  }`}
                  style={{ maxWidth: logo.size === "large" ? "350px" : "220px" }}
                />
              </span>
              <span className="w-2 h-2 md:w-3 md:h-3 bg-neo-accent block rounded-full shrink-0" />
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
        {/* Duplicate for seamless loop */}
        <div
          className="flex animate-marquee"
          aria-hidden="true"
          style={{
            animationDirection: direction === 1 ? "normal" : "reverse",
            animationDuration: `${speed}s`,
          }}
        >
          {/* Même contenu répété */}
        </div>
      </div>
    );
  }

  // Mode texte (fallback)
  // ...
};
```

**Caractéristiques:**
- Utilise `Next.js Image` pour optimiser les images
- Animation `animate-marquee` qui défile horizontalement
- Séparateurs visuels avec points `bg-neo-accent`
- Deux copies du contenu pour une boucle sans couture
- Responsive (hauteurs différentes pour mobile/desktop)

